## Analysis: Two Distinct Causes

The 427 reports in #4471 are not one problem, but two:

### Cause 1: Parser (414 reports)
Date parser reads MM/DD regardless of locale, causing day/month swaps for all day-first locales.

**GitHub Issue:** https://github.com/piotrczarnak/mega/issues/1

### Cause 2: Hint (13 reports)
booking-v3 form shows MM/DD hint to day-first locale users, misleading them into swapping day/month.

**GitHub Issue:** https://github.com/piotrczarnak/mega/issues/2

